1
00:00:00,473 --> 00:00:00,900
Ready?

2
00:00:01,585 --> 00:00:02,183
Throw me!

3
00:00:07,049 --> 00:00:07,974
Oh No My Hair.

4
00:00:08,262 --> 00:00:10,665
A two-player puzzle platformer where your haircut

5
00:00:10,665 --> 00:00:11,700
is your way out.

6
00:00:15,585 --> 00:00:17,190
Two friends visit a salon.

7
00:00:17,478 --> 00:00:19,954
The robot assistant cuts too much, their hair

8
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:22,032
gets powers, and the front door locks.

9
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,047
Now they have to escape together.

10
00:00:27,573 --> 00:00:30,816
Twin-Tails can glide and carry her friend across gaps.

11
00:00:31,473 --> 00:00:34,325
Pompadour can dash through hair gel, parry scissors,

12
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:35,760
and launch her from his head.

13
00:00:36,048 --> 00:00:38,476
Put those abilities together, and you can reach

14
00:00:38,476 --> 00:00:40,602
places neither friend could reach alone.

15
00:00:44,549 --> 00:00:47,767
Here's the problem: this gel curtain grows back.

16
00:00:48,044 --> 00:00:50,000
Carrying your friend gets you to the wall,

17
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:51,991
but you still can't get through.

18
00:00:52,601 --> 00:00:54,400
So she carries him over the gap.

19
00:00:54,688 --> 00:00:56,460
He dashes out of her grip and breaks

20
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:59,181
the gel. She follows before it closes.

21
00:00:59,457 --> 00:01:00,553
Watch their timing.

22
00:01:12,585 --> 00:01:14,417
This time, the door needs a bell that's

23
00:01:14,417 --> 00:01:15,233
out of reach.

24
00:01:15,522 --> 00:01:17,940
A parry sends a scissor back horizontally.

25
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,360
That won't ring it.

26
00:01:19,977 --> 00:01:23,205
Twin-Tails catches the blue scissor, then tosses

27
00:01:23,205 --> 00:01:24,057
it straight up.

28
00:01:24,321 --> 00:01:26,809
The enemy's attack becomes the tool that opens

29
00:01:26,809 --> 00:01:30,040
your route. Both players have a job in that chain.

30
00:01:39,573 --> 00:01:41,857
The salon changes how your hair works.

31
00:01:42,121 --> 00:01:44,382
Get soaked and Twin-Tails can't glide.

32
00:01:44,646 --> 00:01:46,250
Pompadour can't break gel.

33
00:01:46,893 --> 00:01:49,396
Warm air dries you off and lifts Twin-Tails.

34
00:01:49,684 --> 00:01:51,808
Carry your friend into it, and you rise

35
00:01:51,808 --> 00:01:54,029
together. Now you have to choose when to

36
00:01:54,029 --> 00:01:55,185
cross the showers.

37
00:01:59,585 --> 00:02:01,857
Then a barber's chair swaps your haircuts.

38
00:02:02,158 --> 00:02:03,760
The powers go with the hair, so the

39
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,983
person who was carrying now needs a lift.

40
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,585
You have to switch jobs.

41
00:02:09,694 --> 00:02:12,160
The escape ends at the robot assistant.

42
00:02:12,424 --> 00:02:15,267
It charges, throws scissors, and brings in backup.

43
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:17,815
Stun it, launch your friend, and land on

44
00:02:17,815 --> 00:02:20,097
its head. The moves you've learned become your

45
00:02:20,097 --> 00:02:21,532
way through the final fight.

46
00:02:23,718 --> 00:02:25,623
We're making this for two people who enjoy

47
00:02:25,623 --> 00:02:28,769
solving something together, sharing one keyboard.

48
00:02:29,033 --> 00:02:30,954
The prototype runs in a browser.

49
00:02:31,578 --> 00:02:33,786
PICO PARK and ibb and obb are useful

50
00:02:33,786 --> 00:02:36,796
reference points. Our focus is these hair-powered

51
00:02:36,796 --> 00:02:40,112
combinations, inside one mischievous salon.

52
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,970
The playable prototype has four chapters, twelve

53
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:47,947
rooms, saved progress, and a three-phase boss.

54
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,270
It starts with learning each haircut, then asks

55
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:53,372
you to combine them under new conditions.

56
00:02:53,661 --> 00:02:55,508
Every exit needs both friends.

57
00:02:55,784 --> 00:02:58,384
You can try the full prototype on itch dot io.

58
00:03:00,552 --> 00:03:05,130
We're NPC Union: ChenHongshan333 and ZSYUYIIE.

59
00:03:05,418 --> 00:03:07,469
This started in a forty-eight-hour jam with the

60
00:03:07,469 --> 00:03:08,686
theme Better Together.

61
00:03:09,336 --> 00:03:11,960
We've kept iterating on the escape, the rooms,

62
00:03:12,127 --> 00:03:14,023
and how the two players help each other.

63
00:03:16,185 --> 00:03:18,624
Next, we want twenty pairs to play without

64
00:03:18,624 --> 00:03:20,120
us explaining the puzzles.

65
00:03:20,384 --> 00:03:22,171
Can they learn the first combo?

66
00:03:22,447 --> 00:03:23,773
Where do they keep failing?

67
00:03:24,061 --> 00:03:25,617
Do they choose another room?

68
00:03:26,253 --> 00:03:28,365
Our proposed twelve-week plan starts with those

69
00:03:28,365 --> 00:03:31,241
tests and clearer tutorials, then room and audio

70
00:03:31,241 --> 00:03:34,578
polish, followed by accessibility, bug fixes,

71
00:03:34,578 --> 00:03:36,001
and release preparation.

72
00:03:36,289 --> 00:03:38,550
Those player results are still ahead of us.

73
00:03:40,706 --> 00:03:43,145
We estimate seventeen thousand two hundred US

74
00:03:43,145 --> 00:03:45,587
dollars for that twelve-week production plan.

75
00:03:45,851 --> 00:03:48,633
It covers our time, commissioned art and audio,

76
00:03:49,092 --> 00:03:51,692
launch costs, and a twenty-percent buffer.

77
00:03:52,346 --> 00:03:54,652
The immediate help we're looking for is playtesters

78
00:03:54,652 --> 00:03:57,045
and mentoring on onboarding and release planning.

79
00:03:59,330 --> 00:04:01,017
Grab the person next to you and try

80
00:04:01,017 --> 00:04:03,311
the prototype. We'd love to see how you

81
00:04:03,311 --> 00:04:04,466
solve it together.

82
00:04:05,079 --> 00:04:06,717
Scan the code to play Oh No My

83
00:04:06,717 --> 00:04:08,648
Hair. Thanks for watching.
